ama-best-friends","type":"Story","byline":"Jeff Legwold","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top DE D.J. Jacobs commits to Miami hours after pulling Ohio State commitment","description":"Five-star defensive end D.J. Jacobs, the No. 2 overall recruit in the 2027 class, committed to Miami on Thursday hours after pulling his commitment from Ohio State.","published":"2026-11-26T22:58:35.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50606746/top-de-recruit-dj-jacobs-commits-miami-hours-decommitting-ohio-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"D.J. Jacobs decommits from Ohio State, sources say, making top DE available again","description":"D.J. Jacobs, the No. 2 overall recruit in the 2027 class, has decommitted from Ohio State, sources told ESPN, with Tennessee, Georgia and Miami among the leading contenders for the five-star defensive end.","published":"2026-11-26T21:21:16.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50606035/sources-de-dj-jacobs-decommits-ohio-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Friday Night Lights,' 'Ted Lasso' top poll ranking 21st-century sports shows","description":"A Seton Hall poll crowns America's favorite modern fictional sports TV series.﻿","published":"2026-11-26T16:01:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/story/_/id/50576889/top-fictional-sports-series-21st-century","type":"Story","byline":"Brianna Williams","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"The oldest grudge in football","description":"When Texas Tech and its brash benefactor bought their way into the college football big time, they were settling an old West Texas score.","published":"2026-11-26T13:12:44.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50427039/texas-tech-puf-cody-campbell","type":"Story","byline":"Dave Wilson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Take a 360-degree look at college football's iconic rivalry trophies","description":"Whether ancient, animal or absurd, college football's rivalry trophies take many shapes.","published":"2026-11-26T13:09:54.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/feature/story/_/id/50371090/college-football-rivalry-trophies","type":"Eticket","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"USC band won't perform at UCLA football game after members vandalized campus","description":"The USC Trojan Marching Band will not perform during Saturday's rivalry game against UCLA after members of the band vandalized a portion of UCLA's campus.","published":"2026-11-26T14:39:43.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50600615/usc-band-perform-members-vandalized-ucla-campus","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Paolo Uggetti","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Kent State TD overturned by replay was incorrect decision, MAC says","description":"A Kent State touchdown catch should not have been overturned by replay to incomplete at the end of Tuesday's 17-12 loss to Eastern Michigan, the Mid-American Conference said Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-25T23:05:40.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50597875/kent-state-td-overturned-replay-was-incorrect-mac-says","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2027 College Football Playoff National Championship odds","description":"Odds and futures to win the 2027 College Football Playoff National Championship.","published":"2026-11-25T19:44:57.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/47664633/2027-college-football-playoff-national-championship-odds-futures","type":"Story","byline":"Doug Greenberg","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4871079/boubacar-traore","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boubacar_Traore_(American_football)"},"pick":{"pick":25,"round":1,"team":"PHI","via":"JAX","provisional":true},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Boubacar Traore (American football)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boubacar_Traore_(American_football)","description":"American football player (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-26T23:15:22Z","intro":"Boubacar Traore (born October 24, 2004) is an American college football defensive end for the Notre Dame Fighting Irish.","sections":[{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a true freshman at Notre Dame in 2023, Traore played in five games, totaling one sack and a forced fumble. He became a starter in 2024 after an injury to Jordan Botelho and recorded a 34-yard interception return touchdown against Purdue in the third game of the season. He was the team's leader in sacks (3) and tackles-for-loss (5) before suffering a season-ending knee injury in the fifth game of the season."}]}}